Style>0</Style><Color>#1A2E38</Color></Char><Para IX="0"><HorzAlign>0</HorzAlign></Para><Text>a draft to change future approvals.</Text></Shape><Shape ID="50" Type="Shape" LineStyle="0" FillStyle="0" TextStyle="0"><XForm><PinX>13.54205576578776</PinX><PinY>5.947434955173069</PinY><Width>2.778555976019965</Width><Height>0.3366110059950087</Height><LocPinX>1.3892779880099826</LocPinX><LocPinY>0.16830550299750435</LocPinY></XForm><Fill><FillPattern>0</FillPattern></Fill><Line><LinePattern>0</LinePattern></Line><TextBlock><LeftMargin>0</LeftMargin><RightMargin>0</RightMargin><TopMargin>0</TopMargin><BottomMargin>0</BottomMargin><VerticalAlign>0</VerticalAlign></TextBlock><Char IX="0"><Font>0</Font><Size>0.19444444444444445</Size><Style>0</Style><Color>#1A2E38</Color></Char><Para IX="0"><HorzAlign>0</HorzAlign></Para><Text>Submission must resolve active</Text></Shape><Shape ID="51" Type="Shape" LineStyle="0" FillStyle="0" TextStyle="0"><XForm><PinX>13.542447408040365</PinX><PinY>5.660231060451931</PinY><Width>2.7793392605251737</Width><Height>0.3366110059950087</Height><LocPinX>1.3896696302625868</LocPinX><LocPinY>0.16830550299750435</LocPinY></XForm><Fill><FillPattern>0</FillPattern></Fill><Line><LinePattern>0</LinePattern></Line><TextBlock><LeftMargin>0</LeftMargin><RightMargin>0</RightMargin><TopMargin>0</TopMargin><BottomMargin>0</BottomMargin><VerticalAlign>0</VerticalAlign></TextBlock><Char IX="0"><Font>0</Font><Size>0.19444444444444445</Size><Style>0</Style><Color>#1A2E38</Color></Char><Para IX="0"><HorzAlign>0</HorzAlign></Para><Text>approvers. A route that needs a</Text></Shape><Shape ID="52" Type="Shape" LineStyle="0" FillStyle="0" TextStyle="0"><XForm><PinX>13.825653076171875</PinX><PinY>5.373026741875543</PinY><Width>3.3457505967881946</Width><Height>0.3366110059950087</Height><LocPinX>1.6728752983940973</LocPinX><LocPinY>0.16830550299750435</LocPinY></XForm><Fill><FillPattern>0</FillPattern></Fill><Line><LinePattern>0</LinePattern></Line><TextBlock><LeftMargin>0</LeftMargin><RightMargin>0</RightMargin><TopMargin>0</TopMargin><BottomMargin>0</BottomMargin><VerticalAlign>0</VerticalAlign></TextBlock><Char IX="0"><Font>0</Font><Size>0.19444444444444445</Size><Style>0</Style><Color>#1A2E38</Color></Char><Para IX="0"><HorzAlign>0</HorzAlign></Para><Text>requester's leader cannot start without</Text></Shape><Shape ID="53" Type="Shape" LineStyle="0" FillStyle="0" TextStyle="0"><XForm><PinX>13.309985690646702</PinX><PinY>5.085822423299153</PinY><Width>2.3144158257378473</Width><Height>0.3366110059950087</Height><LocPinX>1.1572079128689237</LocPinX><LocPinY>0.16830550299750435</LocPinY></XForm><Fill><FillPattern>0</FillPattern></Fill><Line><LinePattern>0</LinePattern></Line><TextBlock><LeftMargin>0</LeftMargin><RightMargin>0</RightMargin><TopMargin>0</TopMargin><BottomMargin>0</BottomMargin><VerticalAlign>0</VerticalAlign></TextBlock><Char IX="0"><Font>0</Font><Size>0.19444444444444445</Size><Style>0</Style><Color>#1A2E38</Color></Char><Para IX="0"><HorzAlign>0</HorzAlign></Para><Text>an active assigned leader.</Text></Shape><Shape ID="54" Type="Shape" LineStyle="0" FillStyle="0" TextStyle="0"><XForm><PinX>13.828668382432726</PinX><PinY>3.535398695203993</PinY><Width>3.351781209309896</Width><Height>0.3366105821397569</Height><LocPinX>1.675890604654948</LocPinX><LocPinY>0.16830529106987846</LocPinY></XForm><Fill><FillPattern>0</FillPattern></Fill><Line><LinePattern>0</LinePattern></Line><TextBlock><LeftMargin>0</LeftMargin><RightMargin>0</RightMargin><TopMargin>0</TopMargin><BottomMargin>0</BottomMargin><VerticalAlign>0</VerticalAlign></TextBlock><Char IX="0"><Font>0</Font><Size>0.19444444444444445</Size><Style>0</Style><Color>#1A2E38</Color></Char><Para IX="0"><HorzAlign>0</HorzAlign></Para><Text>The active published route determines</Text></Shape><Shape ID="55" Type="Shape" LineStyle="0" FillStyle="0" TextStyle="0"><XForm><PinX>13.52076636420356</PinX><PinY>3.248194376627604</PinY><Width>2.7359771728515625</Width><Height>0.33